# Icons with Colloid (parity/icons.md). Setup copies the user's Colloid into
# the arena's home and removes any icon index, as on the user's laptop
# (standalone: the QML never wrote one).
look material
setup rm -f "$HOME/.cache/tessera/icon-index-"*.tsv; ls "$HOME/.local/share/icons" > /tmp/core-icon-themes.txt 2>&1; true
note the runner copies ~/.local/share/icons/Colloid, Colloid-Light and Colloid-Dark from the host user (cp -a, links kept) into the arena's home before this file, and deletes the arena's ~/.cache/tessera/icon-index-*.tsv
wait 6
setup wc -l "$HOME/.cache/tessera/icon-index-Colloid.tsv" > /tmp/core-icon-index.txt 2>&1; true
note /tmp/core-icon-index.txt: over 50000 lines (Rust writes the index; the QML's icon-index.py too)
shot dock
note dock: Files, the terminal, Settings, the App Drawer in Colloid's icons (compare Colloid-Light/apps/scalable/<name>.svg), none blank
ipc panels open launchpad TESSERA-TEST
wait 1.5
shot launchpad-page-1
ptr move 960 540 scroll 0 5
wait 1
shot launchpad-page-2
ipc panels close
note launchpad: count blank or generic icons; each one: the entry's Icon= and whether Colloid has it
# windows: foot, the file manager, the calculator
setup foot >/dev/null 2>&1 & thunar >/dev/null 2>&1 & gnome-calculator >/dev/null 2>&1 &
wait 3
ipc panels open missionControl TESSERA-TEST
wait 1.5
shot missioncontrol-icons
ipc panels close
ipc panels open overview TESSERA-TEST
wait 1.5
shot overview-icons
key calc
wait 1
shot overview-search-results
key -k Escape
ipc panels close
key -M alt -k Tab
wait 1
shot switcher-icons
key -m alt
wait 1
shot menubar-app
note switcher tiles: 48 px app icon and 16 px badge (not a tiny generic circle); Overview grid badges: 20 px app icons (not a dot); Overview search results and Mission Control's chips and dock: each app's own colour icon (not monochrome glyphs); the menu bar shows the focused app's icon
# notifications with icons
setup notify-send -a Firefox -i firefox 'A' 'b'; notify-send -a Files -i org.gnome.Nautilus 'C' 'd'; notify-send -i dialog-warning 'E' 'f'; notify-send 'No icon' 'g'
wait 2
shot banners
ipc panels open notificationCenter TESSERA-TEST
wait 1.5
shot notification-center-icons
ipc panels close
note banners and the Center: Colloid's firefox, Nautilus, dialog-warning; the generic information icon for the last
setup hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.close({ window = "class:foot" })'; hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.close({ window = "class:thunar" })'; hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.close({ window = "class:org.gnome.Calculator" })'
wait 1
look glass
shot dock-glass
ipc panels open missionControl TESSERA-TEST
wait 1.5
shot missioncontrol-glass
ipc panels close
note the same icons in Glass; with TESSERA_PERF, list any `debug: icon not drawn` line
